Package: fosos-theme
Version: 0.4.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: greybird-gtk-theme, elementary-xfce-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-liberation, dmz-cursor-theme, plymouth, lxpolkit
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS desktop branding and defaults
 Wallpaper, boot splash, login appearance, and greeter defaults.
 The greeter uses Greybird and elementary-xfce. FosOS Desktop uses its own
 GTK and icon themes. lxpolkit provides password prompts.
